    One-page waitlist built from the Figma "SIGNUP · EARLY ACCESS" design,
    hosted on Cloudflare Pages at waitlist.inrl.co. Sign-ups go
    form -> /api/join (Pages Function: validation, honeypot, Turnstile)
    -> Google Apps Script (shared secret, lock, dedupe, literal-text cells)
    -> "INRL Waitlist" Google Sheet.
    
    Includes vitest unit tests for the endpoint and Apps Script, Playwright
    browser tests on desktop and mobile, PLAN.md (eng review and decisions)
    and SETUP.md (go-live steps for Cloudflare, Google and Crazy Domains).
    
